WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:10.550
Soon, very soon...

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:13.110
<b>Ultimate</b>

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:13.110
The world will belong to Gekko!

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:26.060
Episode 12    Eternal Rivals

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:22.370
Delicious!

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:25.210
They're like little hamburgers!

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.350
They're macarons.

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:29.750
And I made lots, so there are plenty 
more where that came from.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.300
Thanks.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.130
Oh, and Desumi-san.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:37.090
It looks like I'm going to 
be in another commercial.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:38.970
Here's the outline.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:41.220
I can't wait!

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.300
What's it for this time?

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.140
It's some bridal thing.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:46.530
<b>Twitch</b>

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:49.270
What? It's just my usual commercial stuff.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:51.650
<b>Kishimoto Weddings, Ltd</b>

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:51.650
<b>New Commercial</b>

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:51.650
<b>Our Wedding Is On</b>

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:51.650
<b>Outline</b>

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:52.180
<i>"Our Wedding Is On"?!</i>

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:52.800
<b>Our Wedding Is On
 Outline</b>

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:53.480
<i>And his costar is...</i>

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:55.400
<b>"Bride"
Anna Hashimoto</b>

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:55.400
<i>The current big star, Hashi-An?!</i>

00:00:55.510 --> 00:01:01.510
<b>The Cutest  Anna Hashimoto</b>

00:00:55.510 --> 00:01:01.510
<b><i>In-Depth Guest</i></b>

00:00:55.510 --> 00:01:01.510
<b>Beshakuri</b>

00:00:55.870 --> 00:01:01.070
<i>The one who just said that Red's 
her favorite member of Gelato 5...</i>

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:04.000
What is it, Desumi-san?

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.870
<i>"Scene 1. The couple enters the chapel."</i>

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:06.250
Desumi-san?

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:10.250
<i>"Scene 2. They gaze at each 
other before the priest."</i>

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:10.250
Hello, Desumi-san?

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:13.400
<i>"Scene 3. They cut the cake."</i>

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:13.400
D-Desumi-san?

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:17.010
<i>Then the line: "For your big 
day, choose Kishimoto Weddings."</i>

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:16.410
Desumi-san?

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:20.530
Fudo-kun...

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:21.500
Y-Yes?

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:24.890
This is one job that you dare not accept.

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:26.140
Wh-Why not?!

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.610
But I have to, Desumi-san!

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:31.190
The rest of the team turned them down!

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:35.170
My fans would be distraught to 
see me in a commercial like that!

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:36.400
I'll pass, thanks.

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:39.490
It's incompatible with my image.

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:42.140
So I'm the only one left!

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:43.370
Well, you can't do it, either!

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:45.420
What's wrong with you, Desumi-san?

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:47.350
You've never been this selfish before.

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:49.880
Selfish?

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:51.870
This is my job.

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:52.960
How can I—

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:54.200
Fine, then!

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:57.130
Go cut your cake with Hashi-An or whatever!

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:59.140
Wait, Desumi-san!

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:00.840
Desumi-san!

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:04.190
What in the world happened there?

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:06.340
I heard everything!

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:08.460
Haru-kun?

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:10.400
It's not nice to eavesdrop!

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.380
But yes, please tell me...

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.650
Why is Desumi-san so upset?

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:17.050
It's just a commercial!

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:18.390
"Just a commercial..."

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:20.110
Yet it <i>is</i> a commercial.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.870
Try to imagine it, Senpai.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:27.620
The person you most love, cutting a
 cake with a total stranger...

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:30.450
Cutting a cake...

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:35.750
<b>Guahhh!!</b>

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:38.010
Do you grasp it now, Senpai?

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:43.470
What an incorrigible fool I've been!

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:45.760
You can still make it right!

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:49.140
What's all this, now?

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.140
<b>Thump</b>

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:52.770
I just realized that I can't 
do the cake-cutting scene!

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.650
Please, let me withdraw from the commercial!

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.400
Why can't you do the cake-cutting scene?

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.510
Nothing doing!

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:01.530
Kishimoto Weddings is a 
very important sponsor!

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:02.970
I'm begging you!

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:03.780
Honestly!

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:05.930
All right, Fudo-kun.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:08.660
<b>Combined Weapon Proposal</b>

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:07.700
Look at this.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:12.140
The combined weapon made up 
from your individual weapons

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:16.570
has been stalled for a while 
due to lack of funding.

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:20.010
But just the other day, it became reality!

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.510
Thanks to their large contribution.

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:27.740
Although it's just a commercial, it's an 
important part of our fight for world peace!

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.860
Please don't be unreasonable.

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:33.260
<i>For the sake of world peace...</i>

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:38.060
<i>But is it worth making Desumi-san unhappy?</i>

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.790
I made lots!

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:41.820
That's it!

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:44.200
What now?

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:46.250
<i>I'll make my own cake</i>

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:51.580
<i>and do my first cake-cutting with Desumi 
before the commercial is filmed!</i>

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:53.080
No!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.000
It's not good enough.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.140
<b>Fudo</b>

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.140
<b>You have no new messages</b>

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.670
I ain't goin' in there!

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:19.900
Too dangerous.

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:22.000
What's all this about?

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.270
W-Well, you see...

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:27.530
<b>Menacing</b>

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:29.540
Is that...

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:31.500
Reaper-san?

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:36.020
He hasn't called me in two whole days!

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:38.130
Stupid, stupid, stupid Fudo!

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.760
<i>All squad leaders and 
Princess Series members,</i>

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.380
<i>report to the conference room at once.</i>

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:54.640
Your attention, please!

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:56.900
The time is nigh!

00:04:56.900 --> 00:05:01.480
This is the birth of our greatest 
monster yet, the Ultimate Phantom!

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.820
<i>For the sake of any viewers 
who may have forgotten,</i>

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:06.320
<b>Allow me to explain!</b>

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:06.320
<i>allow me to explain once more!</i>

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:08.090
<b>Negative</b>

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.930
Negative Energy

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:10.710
<i>Secret Society Gekko is trying to use 
the negative energy emitted by humans</i>

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:16.580
Ultimate Phantom

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:15.470
<i>to fuel the creation of the Ultimate 
Phantom, their greatest monster yet!</i>

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.620
Hey, about dang time!

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:24.090
It is your diligent efforts that 
have made this day possible!

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:27.840
Behold! It's filled to the 
brim with negative energy!

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:31.100
Now, let us celebrate!

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:35.620
<i>Celebrate... Cake...</i>

00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:37.890
<i>Cutting a cake...</i>

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:42.920
At last, our plans for world 
domination will bear fruit!

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.790
I feel you, Reaper Princess.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.740
Our day is finally here!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.010
<i>Stupid Fudo...</i>

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:56.160
Now, awaken!

00:05:58.310 --> 00:06:03.150
Our greatest monster, Ultimate Phantom!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:05.630
<b>Ultimate</b>

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:21.190
Pucka-pucka.

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:25.270
Goo-goo.

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:29.500
Pucka-pucka. Pucka.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:31.540
It's not quite what I'd imagined.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:33.580
Looks pretty weak to me.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.250
Is it... a failure?

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:38.040
I-It can't be!

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:41.630
I created you for but one purpose!

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:44.960
Destroy humanity and bring 
about our dream of—

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:51.020
Owie!

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:57.560
Wh-What in the world?!

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:58.140
Bosslar-sama!

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.450
What?!

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:06.330
Is it...

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:07.150
...out of control?

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:15.410
Why... Why?!

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.200
Ultimate Phantom!

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:20.960
Bad little boys who don't do as they're told

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:23.460
need punishment!

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:34.050
<b>Major Yikes Kannonflame</b>

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:40.980
Right here, kid!

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:46.480
<b>Rampaging Lion Claws</b>

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.480
Rampaging Lion Claws!

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.960
Bloody Slicer!

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:48.960
<b>Bloody Slicer</b>

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.410
Duàn Zuì Liè Lún!

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:53.410
<b>Duàn Zuì Liè Lún</b>

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.150
How d'you like that?

00:08:08.070 --> 00:08:10.760
Step aside, Princess Series!

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:12.010
Fire!

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.400
Did we do it?!

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:33.660
What?!

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:35.320
It did nothing—

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.740
C-Culverin Bear-sama!

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:46.830
It ate him?!

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:51.170
Damn you!

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:02.060
It integrates whatever it eats?

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:09.500
N-Not good!

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:30.750
Desumi
Fudo

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:36.170
Radiance

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:36.170
All done!

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:40.180
Fudo-kun, it's time to head to the shoot!

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:41.650
Yes, sir!

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:53.540
Fudo-san!

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:54.990
Hashimoto-san!

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:00.990
Hey! What's with you, Reaper?

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:03.440
It ate Bear-sama!

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:05.910
Oh, for... Can someone 
here get real already?!

00:10:06.860 --> 00:10:10.420
It's heading for the city! 
We have to go after it!

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:16.420
<i>Please... pick up, Desumi-san!</i>

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:18.650
Are you all right?

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:20.390
Ow, ow...

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.890
Yes, thanks. I'm fine.

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:23.010
<b>Fudo</b>

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:23.140
<b>Fudo</b>

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:23.260
<b>Fudo</b>

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.640
<b>Fudo</b>

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:28.640
Hmph!

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:31.890
Sheesh, what a mess!

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:40.910
What a fool I've been.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:48.360
Fudo-kun, I'd really like to start the shoot.

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:50.670
R-Right. Thanks.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:56.400
<b>Desumi-san
Calling</b>

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:53.880
Desumi-san...

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:03.380
Is something the matter?

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:07.620
Not at all.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:08.890
Really?

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:11.640
Then I hope we can get started!

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:17.150
Time for Scene 3, cutting the cake!

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:23.280
<i>It's begun at last.</i>

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:24.360
Action!

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:40.020
Excuse me, Fudo-san.

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:41.130
You're holding it too hard!

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:45.560
I'm sorry.

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:50.150
<i>I can only cut my first cake with Desumi-san!</i>

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:10.000
Pucka-pucka.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:13.020
<i>What is that monster?!</i>

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:19.670
I'm currently over a wedding venue 
where an explosion just occurred!

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:26.800
<b>BREAKING
CITY WEDDING VENUE
SUDDEN EXPLOSION</b>

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:21.440
<i>Look at this!</i>

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:23.280
<i>The smoke hasn't even settled!</i>

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:26.800
<i>We can't tell if it's an accident 
or intentional at this time.</i>

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:31.900
<i>But it's dangerous to be in the area, 
so we implore everyone to stay away!</i>

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:33.130
The explosion appears to be 
the work of Ultimate Phantom.

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:35.780
<i>I'm getting new information now.</i>

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:41.770
<i>It seems Fudo Aikawa of Gelato 5
 was filming at this venue!</i>

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:45.700
Fudo?

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:48.700
You need to get to safety!

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:50.870
I will!

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:57.690
<i>Is this a new Gekko monster?</i>

00:12:58.280 --> 00:13:00.590
Destroy... humans.

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:07.090
Desumi
Fudo

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:07.090
<i>The cake I made for Desumi-san and me!</i>

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:09.850
Fudo!

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:10.830
You okay?

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:14.860
Did you really just turn 
your back on the enemy?

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:17.060
Come on, let's get transformed!

00:13:17.890 --> 00:13:19.660
Hey... were you crying?

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:21.400
C-Certainly not!

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:26.090
Let's go! Time to transform!

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:32.540
Freezing Change!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:34.290
<i>Five!</i>

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:36.160
<i>Four!</i>

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:37.370
<i>Three!</i>

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:38.440
<i>Two!</i>

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:39.290
<i>One!</i>

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:44.300
<i>Change Gelato!</i>

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:47.930
The aroma of strawberry, 
the flavor of justice!

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:49.820
Red Gelato!

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.680
The aroma of soda, the flavor of courage!

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:56.310
Blue Gelato!

00:13:56.540 --> 00:13:59.440
The aroma of lemon, the flavor of life!

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:01.540
Yellow Gelato!

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:05.190
The aroma of peach, the flavor of love!

00:14:05.930 --> 00:14:07.820
Pink Gelato!

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:11.320
The aroma of pistachio, the flavor of peace!

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:13.140
Green Gelato!

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:15.700
Together, we are...

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:19.210
Freezing Sentai Gelato 5!

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:24.300
Underestimate us on pain of fire!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.540
Here's one for you!

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:47.510
Megaton Lemon Crush!

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:53.620
Misaki-san!

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.540
Let go of her!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:58.260
Sky Peach Rain!

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.610
Right over here!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:06.740
Twin Soda Slash!

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:19.100
Sweet Berry Impact!

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:21.480
Daigo-san!

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:23.560
Right!

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:28.740
Vacuum Pistachio Strike!

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:33.030
Your ferocity is truly admirable.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.750
I only wish we could have 
met under different—

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.000
Guys!

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:46.590
The building's coming down!

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:50.090
<i>Are our heroes safe?!</i>

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:50.090
Oh my!

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:51.720
L-Look at that!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.820
The fight isn't over!

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:57.160
And the giant monster 
seems completely unharmed!

00:15:57.730 --> 00:15:59.310
I'm sorry, Fudo.

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:02.820
And it looks like our heroes 
have taken quite a beating...

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:04.980
How in the world is this going to turn out?

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:11.370
Finally caught up.

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:14.990
It looks like Gekko reinforcements 
have just arrived!

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.680
<i>Not only are they facing a ferocious monster,</i>

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:17.680
Here's our chance!

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:19.870
<i>but the Princess Series 
have also joined the fight!</i>

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:19.870
Go, Gekko!

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:23.800
This might be the greatest 
crisis Gelato 5 has ever faced!

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:27.930
You'll pay.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:30.010
You'll pay!

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:36.060
Iron Prison!

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:37.050
<b>Iron Prison</b>

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:39.850
Oh! There seems to be some 
in-fighting going on!

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:40.970
What could be the cause of it?!

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:43.690
I'll slice you to ribbons!

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:55.530
S-Steel!

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:07.420
Y-You damned monster...

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:12.730
It appears Gekko doesn't have 
control of this monster.

00:17:14.210 --> 00:17:15.680
And now...

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.710
It's devouring the cake!

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:18.930
It just does whatever it wants!

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:25.730
This thing...

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:28.010
The monster's appearance is changing!

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:36.260
Fudo...

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:43.290
Desumi
Fudo

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:55.640
That thing is incredible!

00:17:57.900 --> 00:17:59.360
Red here.

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:01.660
<i>Fudo-kun, hold it horizontal!</i>

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:03.620
<i>Fudo-kun.</i>

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:05.270
<i>We're left with no other choice.</i>

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:08.520
<i>It'll be quite a test run, but you'll 
have to use that weapon we discussed.</i>

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:11.900
<i>The Combiner Sword, Gelato Claymore!</i>

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:15.510
<i>That weapon will surely defeat the monster.</i>

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:17.420
<i>Everyone, combine your weapons!</i>

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:23.900
Let's go!

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:25.790
Combine!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:40.970
Complete! Gelato Claymore!

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:44.070
Are you seeing this, everyone?

00:18:44.070 --> 00:18:47.180
Gelato 5's weapons, and their hearts...

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:48.350
are united!

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:53.220
Everyone!

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:57.610
Blue, Green, Pink, and 
Yellow have been captured!

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:04.290
Red's wound appears quite serious.

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:06.870
What in the world will happen next?!

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:08.670
Damn it!

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:16.380
What is this?!

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:18.340
It can't be!

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:21.480
Reaper Princess joins the battle!

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:23.380
I can't believe what I'm seeing!

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:26.720
Those two eternal rivals... 
working as a team?!

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:28.730
Desumi-san?

00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:31.730
I'm sorry for being selfish.

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:35.600
I'm sure you must hate me now.

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:37.620
I wouldn't. Never ever.

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:40.150
Not even if the heavens fell to the earth!

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:42.790
Fudo!

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:44.650
Desumi-san.

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:47.350
I can't hear what they're saying,

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:50.750
but it's easy to imagine it's 
a heated exchange of insults!

00:19:55.130 --> 00:19:56.590
Are you ready, Fudo?

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:58.630
I am, Desumi-san!

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:25.410
I know they can do this!

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.160
Just do it, Reaper!

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.160
Go!

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:36.250
What? Fudo, is this...

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:38.570
Yes, this is...

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:44.760
...like we're cutting a cake!

00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:56.270
Heck yeah!

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:58.730
Running away with the glory...

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.690
They did it!

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.490
That's my Fudo!

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:04.930
Big Sister!

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:05.860
Big Sis!

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:22.380
Thank you, Desumi-san.

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:25.630
I would have lost for sure if not for you.

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:27.830
I'm the one who should thank you.

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:30.290
You made us a cake, didn't you?

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:33.110
I'd love to actually eat the next one!

00:21:33.110 --> 00:21:35.270
Easily provided, Desumi-san!

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:39.510
This child... isn't it that monster?

00:21:39.510 --> 00:21:41.070
I think it is.

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:43.500
It's too small to cause any 
more harm now, I'm sure.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:46.030
Papa! Mama!

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:47.330
R-Really!

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:49.240
This appears to be a case 
of mistaken identity!

00:21:50.310 --> 00:21:52.510
Honestly, what a silly baby!

00:21:52.510 --> 00:21:54.870
After vanquishing the giant monster,

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:56.660
has a new friendship sprung up between them?!

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:58.420
Let's have an interview!

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:02.210
Rondo of the Reaper!

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:03.050
<b>Reaper Rondo</b>

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:10.180
Th-There's no mutual understanding at all!

00:22:13.510 --> 00:22:16.180
N-Not bad, Reaper Princess!

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:20.150
F-Friendship? Don't be absurd!

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:21.690
I am Reaper Princess.

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:24.070
The cold and merciless devil incarnate!

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:25.570
Never forget that.

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:28.450
Mama! Mama!

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:39.850
Let us meet again, De—

00:22:39.850 --> 00:22:41.040
Reaper Princess!

00:22:42.360 --> 00:22:44.930
A-Any time, Fu—

00:22:44.930 --> 00:22:46.590
Red Gelato!

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:48.340
<i>Allow me to explain!</i>

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:48.340
<b>Allow me to explain!</b>

00:22:48.660 --> 00:22:51.220
<i>This is the story of a hero of justice</i>

00:22:51.220 --> 00:22:52.600
<i>and a secret society's combatant</i>

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:55.950
<i>walking the road of forbidden love!</i>
